g data-key=\"2\" src=\"https://media-one.wavpub.com/shownotes/2c8f93dd-7e49-4927-942f-a84654f1ad66/3aa6bc278ce0a802.png\" alt=\"\" data-origin=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/3d11-audiofreehighqps/C1/57/GMCoOSUIQ8deAAInxgIgspO5.png?op_type=0\" data-large=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/3d11-audiofreehighqps/C1/57/GMCoOSUIQ8deAAInxgIgspO5.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large\" data-large-width=\"750\" data-large-height=\"470.62499999999994\" data-preview=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/3d11-audiofreehighqps/C1/57/GMCoOSUIQ8deAAInxgIgspO5.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_small\" data-preview-width=\"140\" data-preview-height=\"87.85\"></p>\n<p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify\" data-flag=\"normal\">&nbsp;（图片源自网络）</p>\n<p><span><br />\n</span></p>\n<p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:justify\" data-flag=\"normal\"><b>最痛苦的蚊虫叮咬</b></p>\n<p><span><br />\n</span></p>\n<p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:justify\" data-flag=\"normal\">1983年，美国昆虫学家贾斯廷·施密特发表了他的施密特刺痛指数第一版。该指数把子弹蚁——生活在自尼加拉瓜以南的中美洲地区，直至巴拉圭——是昆虫叮咬最疼的一种，疼痛指数4.0+，在施密特的四分制绩点量表中被记录为满分。</p>\n<p><span><br />\n</span></p>\n<p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;text-align:justify\" data-flag=\"normal\"><img data-key=\"3\" src=\"https://media-one.wavpub.com/shownotes/2c8f93dd-7e49-4927-942f-a84654f1ad66/58bc57a3b7cf867e.png\" alt=\"\" data-origin=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/21c4-audiofreehighqps/29/00/GKwRIUEIQ8eFAAaCRgIgsq8o.png?op_type=0\" data-large=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/21c4-audiofreehighqps/29/00/GKwRIUEIQ8eFAAaCRgIgsq8o.png!op_type=4&amp;devic